    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TitTok - Minimalistic adventure 2D puzzle platformer with cats, explosions and spinning saws!</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534260/extras/73481f72bd20afaf304c88c343a1bb88.poster.avif?t=1745381914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534260/extras/73481f72bd20afaf304c88c343a1bb88.webm?t=1745381914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534260/extras/73481f72bd20afaf304c88c343a1bb88.mp4?t=1745381914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>The player's goal is to complete all levels and not die from the attacks of evil enemies.<br>You can find bombs in the levels and use them anywhere!</i><br><br>\u25aa Kitties ^. ^<br>\u25aa 31 levels;<br>\u25aa Platformer levels;<br>\u25aa Levels with puzzles;<br>\u25aa Diverse and evil enemies;<br>\u25aa Spinning deadly saws;<br>\u25aa Bombs and explosions;<br>\u25aa Destruction;<br>\u25aa Double jumps;<br>\u25aa Portals;<br>\u25aa Mask mode;<br>\u25aa Leaderboards and statistics;<br>\u25aa 69 Achievements;<br>\u25aa Boss Helicopter!<br><br><strong>...And in the game you can MEOW at any time ^^</strong><br><strong>TikTok? No! TitTok! TikTok \u2260 TitTok</strong><br><strong>And remember: &quot;Tit before your Tok!&quot;</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TitTok - Minimalistic adventure 2D puzzle platformer with cats, explosions and spinning saws!</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534260/extras/73481f72bd20afaf304c88c343a1bb88.poster.avif?t=1745381914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534260/extras/73481f72bd20afaf304c88c343a1bb88.webm?t=1745381914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534260/extras/73481f72bd20afaf304c88c343a1bb88.mp4?t=1745381914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>The player's goal is to complete all levels and not die from the attacks of evil enemies.<br>You can find bombs in the levels and use them anywhere!</i><br><br>\u25aa Kitties ^. ^<br>\u25aa 31 levels;<br>\u25aa Platformer levels;<br>\u25aa Levels with puzzles;<br>\u25aa Diverse and evil enemies;<br>\u25aa Spinning deadly saws;<br>\u25aa Bombs and explosions;<br>\u25aa Destruction;<br>\u25aa Double jumps;<br>\u25aa Portals;<br>\u25aa Mask mode;<br>\u25aa Leaderboards and statistics;<br>\u25aa 69 Achievements;<br>\u25aa Boss Helicopter!<br><br><strong>...And in the game you can MEOW at any time ^^</strong><br><strong>TikTok? No! TitTok! TikTok \u2260 TitTok</strong><br><strong>And remember: &quot;Tit before your Tok!&quot;</strong>",
